WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:01.418
[BELL RINGS]

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:03.086
♪ Oh, Helpters.
-Yes? ♪

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:04.463
♪ Can you help me by chance? ♪

00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:07.132
♪ You see I've got this big hat
I like to wear when I dance. ♪

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:09.718
♪ That's a really big hat.
- Why thank you, Primm. ♪

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:12.387
♪ But from the moment that
I move, all my troubles begin. ♪

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:15.057
♪ We've got a word for troubles,
and the word is "bugs." ♪

00:00:15.057 --> 00:00:17.851
♪ They're the pesky, little
problems that nobody loves. ♪

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:20.312
♪ We can debug
if you tell us more. ♪

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:22.648
♪ I think I'll show you
on the dance floor. ♪

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:25.150
♪ I've got a big hat.
I've got a big dance. ♪

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:28.153
♪ Gotta move my head,
gotta move my hands. ♪

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:31.031
♪ Do it! ♪

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:37.079
♪

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:39.414
♪ Oh, no! ♪

00:00:39.414 --> 00:00:40.374
♪ Helpsters.
- Yes. ♪

00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:41.750
♪ Did everybody see that? ♪

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.628
♪ Every time I do my dance,
I'm always losing my hat. ♪

00:00:44.628 --> 00:00:47.005
♪ A hat that won't stay,
there's a problem for sure. ♪

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:50.133
♪ Can anybody think of something
that will keep it secure? ♪

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:51.176
♪ Tape it!
- Huh? ♪

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:52.678
♪ That's what I said. ♪

00:00:52.678 --> 00:00:55.138
♪ Tape it on, just attach it
right onto your head. ♪

00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:57.849
♪ Here's a little piece of tape
from the kitchen drawer. ♪

00:00:57.849 --> 00:00:59.893
♪ Now we'll see you
on the dance floor. ♪

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.437
♪ I've got a big hat,
I've got a big dance. ♪

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:05.440
♪ Gotta move my head,
gotta move my hands. ♪

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:10.153
♪ Do it!
Do it! ♪

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:14.157
♪

00:01:14.157 --> 00:01:16.785
♪ Ah, the tape
wasn't strong enough! ♪

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:17.869
♪ Strap it.
- Huh? ♪

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:19.037
♪ Strap it to your chin. ♪

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:20.747
♪ We'll get a strap
from the strap box ♪

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.165
♪ and sew it right in. ♪

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:24.501
♪ The hats are all debugged,
they can't fall anymore. ♪

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.628
♪ So we'll see you
on the dance floor. ♪

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:29.131
♪ We've got big hats.
We've got a big dance. ♪

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:32.134
♪ Gotta move our heads,
gotta move our hands. ♪

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:34.386
♪ Do it! ♪

00:01:34.386 --> 00:01:36.305
♪ Yeah, we do. ♪

00:01:36.305 --> 00:01:38.932
♪ Getting down now.
- Do it! ♪

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:41.560
♪

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:44.688
♪ Woo! Hello!
- Come on! ♪

00:01:44.688 --> 00:01:48.108
♪ Helpsters! ♪

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:52.362
♪

